      "title": "Physiology, Phrenology, and Self-Knowledge",
      "gist": "Fowler contends that physiology teaches the laws of health while phrenology supplies self-knowledge, and together they explain the wide diversity of human character despite a shared bodily structure."
    },
    "n0016": {
      "id": "n0016",
      "depth": 2,
      "parent": "n0015",
      "children": [
