      "range": [
        "spya-gefve6",
        "spya-eks7rr"
      ],
      "title": "The Practical Value of Physiology",
      "gist": "Physiology teaches the laws of life and health, and knowing them prevents childhood ill-health and builds stronger constitutions."
    },
